      {
        "heading": "Local recording is separate from cloud completion",
        "accent": "blue",
        "text": [
          "This fictional proposed design asks whether a failed cloud interaction necessarily means the camera stopped recording. Choose an outcome path to compare confirmed cloud success, confirmed storage-link loss, and a camera-observed timeout.",
          "The physical motion is illustrative. No durations, retry limits, payload identifiers, storage capacities, or field-of-view measurements are supplied."
